WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Step 1: The API comes with Metricool's Advanced and Custom plans. Free and Starter have no API access.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Step 2: In Metricool open Account Settings, then API.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Copy your API access token.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Step 4: Open your brand in Metricool. The numbers after userId= and blogId= in the address are the two IDs.

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Step 5: In your centre, paste the token.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Step 6: Paste the two numbers into userId and blogId.

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Step 7: Click Connect Metricool. The agent checks that the brand belongs to your account.
